pan></text><text for="L28"><span begin="03:00.830" end="03:01.370">kimi</span><span begin="03:01.370" end="03:01.660">no</span><span begin="03:01.660" end="03:02.410">aoi</span><span begin="03:02.410" end="03:03.310">hitomi</span><span begin="03:03.310" end="03:03.530">no</span><span begin="03:03.530" end="03:04.120">naka</span><span begin="03:04.120" end="03:04.410">ni</span><span begin="03:04.410" end="03:04.590">a</span><span begin="03:04.590" end="03:04.780">a</span><span begin="03:04.990" end="03:05.110">wa</span><span begin="03:05.180" end="03:05.460">ta</span><span begin="03:05.730" end="03:06.010">shi</span><span begin="03:06.010" end="03:06.560">wai</span><span begin="03:06.620" end="03:07.300">tai</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="03:07.650" end="03:08.560">wake</span><span begin="03:08.560" end="03:09.170">up</span><span begin="03:09.310" end="03:10.220">wake</span><span begin="03:10.220" end="03:10.790">up</span><span begin="03:10.970" end="03:11.870">babe</span><span begin="03:11.990" end="03:12.370">sa</span><span begin="03:12.370" end="03:12.630">a</span><span begin="03:12.630" end="03:13.450">i</span><span begin="03:13.450" end="03:13.700">ma</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="03:13.730" end="03:14.290">mou</span><span begin="03:14.340" end="03:14.580">i</span><span begin="03:14.580" end="03:14.680">chi</span><span begin="03:14.760" end="03:15.070">do</span><span begin="03:15.350" end="03:15.560">ji</span><span begin="03:15.560" end="03:16.440">bun</span><span begin="03:16.440" end="03:16.740">o</span><span begin="03:17.010" end="03:17.340">ko</span><span begin="03:17.340" end="03:17.540">e</span><span begin="03:17.600" end="03:20.030">te</span><span begin="03:20.300" end="03:20.620">ko</span><span begin="03:20.620" end="03:20.800">e</span><span begin="03:20.910" end="03:23.370">te</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="03:30.000" end="03:30.620">shin</span><span begin="03:30.620" end="03:30.800">ji</span><span begin="03:30.880" end="03:33.780">te</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">曾甘愿沦陷 恍惚于微光之间</text><text for="L2">凝视着幻影 身处这虚幻梦境</text><text for="L3">彷徨于这天际的裂隙</text><text for="L4">缓缓坠落</text><text for="L5">醒悟吧 察觉吧 不可再如此沉沦</text><text for="L6">是啊 我早已知晓</text><text for="L7">醒来吧 醒来吧 挚爱之人 无需畏惧</text><text for="L8">你那碧蓝的眼眸深处 啊 我愿栖身其中</text><text for="L9">醒来吧 醒来吧 挚爱之人 来吧 就在此刻</text><text for="L10">再一次 超越那个自我 跨越束缚</text><text for="L11">请相信我</text><text for="L12">即便是那神圣之人</text><text for="L13">亦饱受生存之罪的折磨</text><text for="L14">传说终将归于尘土</text><text for="L15">在这份爱消逝之后</text><text for="L16">漫长的遗忘 是否仍将延续</text><text for="L21">拜托了 求求你 呐 回到我身边</text><text for="L22">这份温存 我不愿失去</text><text for="L23">醒来吧 醒来吧 挚爱之人 无需畏惧</text><text for="L24">奔向你碧蓝眼眸 温柔微笑着的未来</text><text for="L25">醒来吧 醒来吧 挚爱之人 来吧 就在此刻</text><text for="L26">奏响旋律 与你共同描绘这世界</text><text for="L27">醒来吧 醒来吧 挚爱之人 无需畏惧</text><text for="L28">你那碧蓝的眼眸深处 啊 我愿栖身其中</text><text for="L29">醒来吧 醒来吧 挚爱之人 来吧 就在此刻</text><text for="L30">再一次 超越那个自我 跨越束缚</text><text for="L31">请相信我</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:33.780"><div begin="00:16.150" end="03:33.780"><p begin="00:16.150" end="00:21.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:16.150" end="00:16.790">虜</span><span begin="00:16.790" end="00:17.010">に</span><span begin="00:17.010" end="00:18.760">なっていた </span><span begin="00:19.490" end="00:20.080">光</span><span begin="00:20.080" end="00:20.190">う</span><span begin="00:20.250" end="00:20.510">つ</span><span begin="00:20.510" end="00:20.870">らう</span><span begin="00:20.910" end="00:21.150">つ</span><span begin="00:21.150" end="00:21.970">ら</span></p><p begin="00:22.780" end="00:29.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:22.780" end="00:23.600">幻</span><span begin="00:23.600" end="00:23.780">を</span><span begin="00:23.820" end="00:23.920">見</span><span begin="00:24.020" end="00:24.350">てい</span><span begin="00: